Attribution

All code in src/ was written for this project. Two GPLv2 works were used as
technical references and shaped the design; GPLv2 is chosen for compatibility
with them:

  * PS3xPAD by OsirisX - https://github.com/aldostools/PS3xPAD
    Source of the libpad LDD approach: syscalls 573/574 for registering a
    virtual controller with custom capabilities, and CELL_PAD_CTRL_LDD_PS as
    the carrier for the PS button.

  * Linux hid-playstation driver
    https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/drivers/hid/hid-playstation.c
    Reference for the DualShock 4 and DualSense HID report layouts, report
    ids, Bluetooth output CRC32 seeding and sensor resolutions.

RPCS3 (GPLv2) was consulted for the exact numeric values of the cellPad
constants: https://github.com/RPCS3/rpcs3

PlayStation, DualShock and DualSense are trademarks of Sony Interactive
Entertainment. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Sony.
